# Recorded input for the chip page (widgets/chip.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 80 in the default
# theme: Zig, Rust and Draft on a panel; the remove buttons at x 53..70 and 131..148, y 16..34, and Zig's
# caption at x 22..47. One line per frame below (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Enter 40.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 80
dt 0.016
pointer 300 70
# 1: hover Zig's remove button
frame
pointer 61 25
# 2: hold it (it takes focus)
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: Zig's removal asked
frame
buttons
# 4: Enter on the focused remove button: asked again
frame
pointer 300 70
press 40
# 5: press Zig's caption: the chip takes nothing, and focus goes
frame
pointer 34 24
buttons left
# 6: release; Enter now does nothing
frame
buttons
press 40
# 7: press Rust's remove button, drag off, release: nothing asked
frame
pointer 139 25
buttons left
# 8: dragged off
frame
pointer 300 70
# 9: released off it
frame
buttons
